    "data": "<h1>Biliboard术力口周榜</h1><p>创刊于2024年6月12日，继承自日本Billboard周榜，收录包括但不限于使用VOCALOID、UTAU、SynthesizerV、CEVIO、初音ミクNT等音声合成引擎制作的歌曲（统称“术曲”），旨在针对B站的流行趋势对术曲排名，并传播日本虚拟歌姬文化。</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-6\" alt=\"cut-off-6\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/02db465212d3c374a43c60fa2625cc1caeaab796.png\"></figure><h1>排名计算方式</h1><p>0、数据统计周期为上周周二12点至本周周二12点</p><p>1、时间修正</p><p>t = LOG(EXP(DATE([投稿日期])-DATE([最近一期周榜的发布时间的前一天]))/14 + 1)+1</p><p>2、得分计算</p><p>播放基数 = 新增播放 * 时间修正</p><p>得分 = 播放基数 + 新增收藏 * 30 + 新增点赞 * 3 + 新增硬币 * 10 + (投票比值 + 100%) * 播放基数</p><p>投票&amp;提名网站: https://aquarite.uk</p><p>排名并不完全等同于歌曲质量，请理性看待！</p><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img class=\"cut-off-5\" alt=\"cut-off-5\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/article/4adb9255ada5b97061e610b682b8636764fe50ed.png\"></figure><h1>第 20 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nafnYUEac/\" target=\"_blank\">医学</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/45c596115ef103de758c5b22ada7e6f33546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 19 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sDJtzDEMN/\" target=\"_blank\">仿真花束</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cefbbc1d982a50f3fd11127150f52f2648dca89d.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 18 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hs411W7uR/\" target=\"_blank\">妄想感伤代偿联盟</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/17554412200bf8989e76319bd262ce9b3546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 17 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iA5jzxEQL/\" target=\"_blank\">我想当个圣人君子</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/0feea290734f8213e4f20ea81fdc2e973546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 16 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cJ411q7GF/\" target=\"_blank\">春岚</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4d6e243e00a415e5fcc460ef3c2b9f31fe37d7c8.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 15 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uJ411879Y/\" target=\"_blank\">神的随波逐流</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7151a1406fce8281694bc35cee009833639b0a9a.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 14 名 - 虚荣屠夫</h1><p>(视频已失效QAQ)</p><p><br></p><h1>第 13 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cZw9eDERz/\" target=\"_blank\">心灵感应</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/fece47125a0a7daf0d552b750636e8a33546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 12 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1euAPePE1y/\" target=\"_blank\">舞动吧中国</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/8bd4e362972788393d2aa6dba96d74ad3546800279522160.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 11 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nvKnewEcU/\" target=\"_blank\">超级主角</a></h1><p><br></p><figure class=\"img-box\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a96015ca8705340b1fa9b6ba33ba311f668c8fbc.jpg\"><figcaption class=\"caption\" contenteditable=\"\"></figcaption></figure><h1>第 10 名 - <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15